{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里仍没底\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他亲身试过，真去做能让自己从无力里动起来，可那股力气没能让他放下对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"从无力里动起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得放下争取，也舍不得那种生活给他的安慰，可光靠怀念护不住眼下珍惜的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得放下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到要付出的代价，他心里还是疼，盼着别失去太多，可眼前该争取的事不能一直搁着。\",\n      \"key\": \"别失去太多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想出能两边都顾到的办法，还是决定先做眼前该争取的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"先做眼前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后重新考虑能做什么的起点，由 S10-5 直接解释，不把看清愿望写成已经能够行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动能让他从无力中动起来、却不能消掉牵挂的两面经验，避免重复强调行动带来的力量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留争取与旧愿带来的安慰都难以放下，以及安慰不能保护珍惜之物的限度。限度接回 S07-2 中珍惜之物仍受威胁的经历，不再由单纯的满足推出；删去重复的自责式总结，让难处直接落在两边都舍不得上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留代价带来的心疼、希望少失去一些，以及眼前的事不能一直搁置。删去等待无用、不行动也可能失去的重复道理，S07-3 只用来说明害怕受损的心情仍在起作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把带着没把握仍然行动落到具体决定上：他还没找到能顾及两边的办法，却开始做眼前该争取的事。删去重复的恐惧宣言，并移除 S02-1 到 S11-6 的弱箭头，改由本段已经看见代价、不能继续搁置的经历引出行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a11cf6c-b74f-4533-b74b-4c676d08d12d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T192111256721Z", "elapsed_seconds": 576.36, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:30:47.631947+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b96430d1922e00a412ce775abe2ec4417d2e006d8caf02f9184340b0a6b09737", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b94